<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><meta content="#fff9ef" name="theme-color"/><title>Portofolio Zaira | Data Analyst &amp; Business Analysis</title><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/><link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;family=Fredoka:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/><style>
:root{--ink:#34322f;--cream:#fff9ef;--pink:#ffc8d9;--lilac:#dcd1ff;--mint:#d2efcf;--yellow:#ffe8a3;--orange:#ffd7b7;--paper:#fffefb;--line:#393833;--muted:#77716b}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;overflow-x:hidden}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button{font:inherit}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 34px}.pill{border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:40px;padding:10px 18px;font-weight:800;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--paper);box-shadow:3px 4px 0 var(--line)}.topline{background:#d8efcc;text-align:center;padding:9px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--line)}nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px;gap:14px}.logo{font:700 27px Fredoka,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-1px}.logo span{color:#ec7e9e}.navlinks{display:flex;gap:30px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.navlinks a:hover{color:#cf6792}.hire{background:var(--pink);padding:12px 22px;border-radius:22px;border:2px solid var(--line);font-weight:800;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 var(--line)}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.18fr .82fr;align-items:center;gap:36px;min-height:630px;padding-top:55px;padding-bottom:70px;position:relative}.tiny{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase}.tiny .dot{height:9px;width:9px;background:#6ab878;border-radius:100%}.hero h1{font:700 clamp(64px,7.9vw,112px)/.97 Fredoka,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-4px;margin:22px 0}.hero h1 .bubble{background:var(--pink);padding:0 15px;border-radius:30px;white-space:nowrap}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#a498e6}.lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;max-width:520px;color:#595751}.cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin-top:28px}.btn{display:inline-block;padding:15px 24px;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--yellow);font-weight:800;box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--line);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}.btn:hover{transform:translate(3px,3px);box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--line)}.btn.secondary{background:var(--paper)}.heroart{height:490px;position:relative}.arch{position:absolute;inset:32px 27px 18px 37px;border:3px solid var(--line);border-radius:190px 190px 33px 33px;background:#e8ddff;box-shadow:9px 11px 0 #c8e4bd;overflow:hidden}.sun{position:absolute;width:270px;height:270px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffefb8;left:50%;top:62px;transform:translateX(-50%)}.portrait{position:absolute;bottom:-2px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:225px;height:285px;background:#45403e;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:115px 115px 20px 20px}.face{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);top:45px;width:145px;height:165px;background:#f5ba9a;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:65px 65px 75px 75px}.hair{position:absolute;left:23px;top:18px;width:175px;height:150px;border-radius:95px 95px 35px 30px;border:3px solid var(--ink);background:#413737}.eyes{position:absolute;top:110px;left:76px;font-weight:bold;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:20px;z-index:2}.smile{position:absolute;top:153px;left:101px;border-bottom:3px solid #9f554f;border-radius:50%;height:17px;width:27px;z-index:2}.shirt{position:absolute;bottom:-20px;left:3px;width:215px;height:110px;background:#ffcadb;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:80px 80px 5px 5px;z-index:4}.arttag{position:absolute;z-index:6;background:white;border:2px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:4px 5px 0 var(--ink);padding:11px 16px;border-radius:13px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.tag1{left:-2px;top:125px;transform:rotate(-9deg)}.tag2{right:-7px;bottom:79px;transform:rotate(8deg);background:var(--yellow)}.asterisk{font:700 83px Fredoka,sans-serif;position:absolute;right:-1px;top:-17px;color:#f5a2bd;text-shadow:2px 2px #333}.star{position:absolute;font:700 48px Fredoka;left:5px;bottom:0;color:#e9a86a}.marquee{background:var(--pink);border-block:2px solid var(--ink);overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;padding:17px 0;font:600 18px Fredoka;letter-spacing:2px}.marquee div{display:inline-block;animation:scroll 24s linear infinite}@keyframes scroll{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}section{padding-top:100px;padding-bottom:100px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:17px;color:#8b7181}.sectitle{font:700 clamp(36px,5vw,64px)/1.1 Fredoka;letter-spacing:-1.5px}.sectitle i{font-style:normal;color:#e895a9}.sectiontop{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px;margin-bottom:36px}.sectiontop p{max-width:330px;color:#77716b;line-height:1.7}.about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}.aboutbox{border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:26px;padding:33px;background:var(--paper);box-shadow:6px 7px 0 var(--ink)}.aboutbox.purple{background:var(--lilac)}.aboutbox h3{font:700 30px Fredoka;margin-bottom:17px}.aboutbox p{line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:0}.chips{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:25px}.chip{font-weight:700;font-size:12px;background:white;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:30px;padding:9px 13px}.projects{background:#f5f0ff;border-block:2px solid var(--ink)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:27px}.project{background:#fffdf8;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:25px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:6px 7px 0 var(--ink);transition:transform .2s}.project:hover{transform:translateY(-5px)}.projectvisual{height:265px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:grid;place-items:center}.projectvisual.green{background:#d6f0d7}.projectvisual.yellow{background:#ffe8b5}.projectvisual.pink{background:#ffd9e7}.projectvisual.blue{background:#d8e7ff}.mockwindow{width:72%;height:72%;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:13px;background:#fffdf7;box-shadow:8px 9px 0 #35332f;transform:rotate(-5deg);padding:13px}.winbar{display:flex;gap:5px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}.winbar b{width:8px;height:8px;border:1px solid var(--ink);border-radius:50%;background:#ffc4d7}.winbar b:nth-child(2){background:#ffe8ad}.winbar b:nth-child(3){background:#c3ebc0}.chart{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-around;height:100px;padding:18px 20px 0}.chart span{background:#9fcba0;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);width:16%;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0}.chart span:nth-child(1){height:35%}.chart span:nth-child(2){height:75%;background:#ffbed3}.chart span:nth-child(3){height:54%;background:#e0d2fe}.chart span:nth-child(4){height:93%;background:#ffdf99}.bigemoji{font-size:104px;filter:drop-shadow(7px 8px 0 #45413c22);transform:rotate(-11deg)}.decosticker{position:absolute;border:2px solid #34322f;background:white;padding:8px 13px;border-radius:9px;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;transform:rotate(12deg);right:23px;top:27px}.projectbody{padding:27px 27px 30px}.projectbody .index{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:800;color:#888}.projectbody h3{font:700 28px Fredoka;margin:10px 0}.projectbody p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#67635d;min-height:50px}.projectbody a{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;border-bottom:2px solid #e895a9;padding-bottom:4px}.skillsarea{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:65px;align-items:center}.skillcards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.skill{border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:19px;min-height:145px;padding:22px;box-shadow:4px 5px 0 var(--ink)}.skill:nth-child(1){background:var(--pink);transform:rotate(-3deg)}.skill:nth-child(2){background:var(--yellow);transform:rotate(3deg)}.skill:nth-child(3){background:var(--mint);transform:rotate(2deg)}.skill:nth-child(4){background:var(--lilac);transform:rotate(-2deg)}.skill strong{display:block;font:700 22px Fredoka;margin:15px 0 5px}.skill small{font-size:12px}.journey{background:#fff0e9;border-block:2px solid var(--ink)}.timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}.timecard{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:22px;padding:28px;box-shadow:5px 6px 0 var(--ink)}.timecard .year{display:inline-block;background:var(--lilac);border-radius:12px;padding:8px 12px;font-weight:900;font-size:12px}.timecard h3{font:700 22px Fredoka;margin:20px 0 10px}.timecard p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#68625d}.contact{position:relative;text-align:center;padding-top:110px;padding-bottom:110px}.contactcard{background:var(--mint);padding:70px 20px;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:35px;box-shadow:9px 10px 0 var(--ink)}.contactcard h2{font:700 clamp(42px,6vw,80px)/1.1 Fredoka;letter-spacing:-2px;margin-bottom:20px}.contactcard p{line-height:1.7}.contactcard .btn{margin-top:24px;background:var(--pink)}footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding-top:25px!important;padding-bottom:32px!important;font-size:13px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink)}.floating{position:absolute;font-size:54px;animation:float 4s ease-in-out infinite}@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-13px) rotate(9deg)}}.fl1{left:4%;top:55px}.fl2{right:5%;bottom:40px;animation-delay:1s}.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .65s,transform .65s}.reveal.show{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}@media(max-width:850px){.navlinks{display:none}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:35px}.heroart{max-width:420px;width:100%;margin:auto}.about,.skillsarea{grid-template-columns:1fr}.timeline{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(58px,12vw,95px)}}@media(max-width:570px){.wrap{padding-left:22px;padding-right:22px}.hero{gap:8px}.heroart{height:410px}.arch{inset:17px 27px 12px 27px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sectiontop{display:block}.skillcards{gap:10px}.skill{padding:15px;min-height:126px}.skill strong{font-size:18px}.topline{font-size:10px}.hire{padding:10px 13px;font-size:12px}.hero h1{letter-spacing:-2px}.lead{font-size:15px}section{padding-top:70px;padding-bottom:70px}.projectvisual{height:230px}.aboutbox{padding:23px}.contactcard{padding:60px 18px}.fl1,.fl2{display:none}footer{flex-direction:column;text-align:center}}

.timeline{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.projectbody p{min-height:92px}.contactlinks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:11px;justify-content:center;margin-top:22px}.contactlinks a{display:inline-flex;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:15px;padding:11px 15px;font-weight:800;background:#fffdfa;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 var(--ink);font-size:13px}.contactlinks a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}.linknote{font-size:11px;opacity:.75;margin:16px 0 0}@media(max-width:850px){.timeline{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style><style>
.realportrait{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 26%;position:absolute;inset:0;display:block}
.gallery-section{background:#fff3f5;border-top:2px solid #34322f;border-bottom:2px solid #34322f}
.gallerygrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:26px}
.photocard{margin:0;background:#fffefb;border:2px solid #34322f;border-radius:24px;padding:12px;box-shadow:7px 8px 0 #dcd1ff;overflow:hidden}
.photocard img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.42;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px;display:block}
.photocard figcaption{padding:17px 8px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.photocard strong{font:600 22px Fredoka,sans-serif}
.photocard span{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#66615e}
.pressbox{margin-top:45px;padding:25px 32px;border:2px solid #34322f;border-radius:24px;background:#e7f1d9;box-shadow:6px 7px 0 #34322f}
.pressbox>span{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px}
.pressbox h3{font:600 27px Fredoka,sans-serif;margin:12px 0}
.pressbox p{max-width:730px;line-height:1.7}
.presslinks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:16px}
.presslinks a{display:inline-block;background:white;border:2px solid #34322f;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}
.presslinks a:hover{background:#ffe8a3}
@media(max-width:700px){.gallerygrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pressbox{padding:22px}.photocard strong{font-size:19px}}
</style><style>.screenshot-visual{padding:17px!important;display:flex!important;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.screenshot-visual img{max-width:100%;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;background:white;border:2px solid #393833;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:5px 5px 0 #393833}.case-study-section{background:#fffdf8;border-bottom:2px solid #34322f}.case-intro{max-width:760px;line-height:1.8;color:#68625d;margin-bottom:28px}.case-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:30px;align-items:start}.case-photo{background:#edebff;border:2px solid #34322f;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:6px 7px 0 #34322f;padding:16px;position:relative}.case-photo img{display:block;width:100%;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #cec6e9}.screenshot-caption{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:14px}.case-detail{background:#fff0f4;border:2px solid #34322f;border-radius:24px;padding:28px;box-shadow:6px 7px 0 #34322f}.case-detail h3{font:700 32px Fredoka;margin:18px 0}.case-detail p{line-height:1.7;font-size:14px}.case-tag{background:#dfd6ff;border-radius:30px;padding:9px 13px;font-weight:900;font-size:12px}.case-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:22px 0}.case-metrics>div{background:white;padding:15px;border:1.5px solid #34322f;border-radius:15px}.case-metrics small{display:block;color:#7b747c;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.5px}.case-metrics strong{display:block;font:700 22px Fredoka;margin-top:6px}.case-note{font-size:12px!important;color:#77716b}.projectvisual.screenshot-visual{height:265px}@media(max-width:850px){.case-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style><style>
.case-subhead{margin-top:34px;margin-bottom:18px}
.case-kicker{display:inline-block;background:#fff;border:2px solid #34322f;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 #34322f;margin-bottom:14px}
.case-subhead h3{font:700 32px Fredoka,sans-serif;margin:8px 0 12px}
.case-subhead p{max-width:760px;line-height:1.8;color:#645f59;margin-bottom:0}
.case-divider{height:2px;background:#34322f;opacity:.15;margin:42px 0}
.case-highlight{background:#fff7d8;border:2px solid #34322f;border-radius:18px;padding:18px 18px 14px;box-shadow:4px 5px 0 #34322f;margin-top:18px}
.case-highlight strong{display:block;font:700 18px Fredoka,sans-serif;margin-bottom:8px}
.case-highlight ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;line-height:1.8;color:#57524d}
.case-copy .mini{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8b7181;margin-bottom:12px}
</style><style>
.academic{padding:90px 0 110px;background:#fff9ef}
.academicsub{font-size:15px;max-width:760px;line-height:1.9;color:#706961;margin-bottom:28px}
.acagrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px}
.acacard{border:2px solid #393833;background:#fffefb;border-radius:25px;box-shadow:6px 7px 0 #393833;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.acavis{height:245px;overflow:hidden;background:#dcd1ff;border-bottom:2px solid #393833;position:relative;padding:15px 25px}
.acavis img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;background:white;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 5px 18px #3333;}
.acavis .bubblelabel{position:absolute;top:16px;left:16px;border:2px solid #393833;border-radius:30px;background:#ffe8a3;padding:7px 12px;font:700 11px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;letter-spacing:1px;box-shadow:2px 3px 0 #393833}
.acacard:nth-child(2) .acavis{background:#d2efcf}.acacard:nth-child(3) .acavis{background:#ffc8d9}.acacard:nth-child(4) .acavis{background:#ffe8a3}
.acabody{padding:24px 26px 27px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}
.acabody h3{font:700 25px/1.17 Fredoka,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.3px;margin:12px 0}
.acabody p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#615d56}
.acaeyebrow{font-weight:800;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#987a95}
.acametric{margin-top:auto;border:1.5px dashed #928c83;background:#f7f3ff;border-radius:14px;padding:13px 15px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65}
.acametric strong{display:block;color:#32302b;font:700 19px Fredoka}
.acatag{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:13px 0 18px}
.acatag span{background:#f5effd;border:1px solid #b6a9c5;border-radius:40px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}
.acalink{align-self:start;margin-top:5px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;border-bottom:2px solid #e895a9;padding-bottom:4px}
.acanote{margin-top:27px;border-left:4px solid #b3a5e5;padding-left:15px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#766e6d}
@media(max-width:790px){.acagrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.acavis{height:215px}.academic{padding:65px 0}.acabody h3{font-size:23px}}
</style><meta content="Portofolio Zaira Nur Azizah — Data Analysis, Excel, Google Sheets, Business Analysis, dan Academic Projects." name="description"/><style>
.nav-cv{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;border:2px solid #34322f;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:13px;background:#fff;white-space:nowrap}
.cv-download{background:#d2efcf!important}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(58px,7vw,96px);line-height:1.03}
.hero .lead{max-width:610px}
.skill:nth-child(1){background:#d2efcf;transform:rotate(-1deg)}
.skill:nth-child(2){background:#e5ddff;transform:rotate(1deg)}
.skill:nth-child(3){background:#ffe8b5;transform:rotate(0)}
.skill:nth-child(4){background:#f5dbe6;transform:rotate(-1deg)}
@media(max-width:720px){.nav-cv{font-size:12px;padding:8px 10px}.hero h1{letter-spacing:-2px}.cta{gap:12px}}
</style><style>
.source-section{background:#f5f8f1;border-top:2px solid #34322f;border-bottom:2px solid #34322f;padding:82px 0}
.source-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:26px;margin-top:30px}
.source-card{background:#fffefa;border:2px solid #34322f;border-radius:23px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:5px 6px 0 #34322f}
.source-img{display:block;width:100%;height:245px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;border-bottom:2px solid #34322f}
.source-content{padding:23px}.source-content h3{font:700 27px Fredoka,sans-serif;margin:4px 0 10px}
.source-content p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#645f59}
.source-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#8061ad;letter-spacing:1px}
.source-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:16px 0}
.source-chips span{padding:6px 10px;border-radius:30px;background:#f0eaff;border:1px solid #9990ae;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}
.source-note{margin-top:26px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#625f5b}
@media(max-width:780px){.source-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.source-img{height:220px}}
</style><style>.contribution-note{background:#f0eaff;border:1px solid #8e80ad;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin:14px 0}.contribution-note strong{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.7px;color:#6a4f88}.contribution-note p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;margin:6px 0 0;color:#4b4357}.contribution-note p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}</style></head><body><div class="topline">✿ OPEN FOR COLLABORATION &amp; CREATIVE IDEAS ✿</div><nav class="wrap"><a class="logo" href="#home">Portofolio <span>Zaira</span></a><div class="navlinks"><a href="#about">About me</a><a href="#work">My works</a><a href="#academic-projects">Academic projects</a><a href="#skills">My superpowers</a><a href="#journey">Journey</a><a href="#gallery">Gallery</a><a href="#data-sourcing">Data sources</a></div><a class="nav-cv" download="CV_Zaira_Nur_Azizah.pdf" href="data:application/pdf;base64,">↓ CV</a><a class="hire" href="#contact">Say hello ↗</a></nav><main><header class="wrap hero" id="home"><div><div class="tiny"><span class="dot"></span> HI, NICE TO MEET YOU! ♡</div><h1>Turning <em>data</em> into<br/><span class="bubble">insight. ✦</span></h1><p class="lead">Aku <b>Zaira Nur Azizah</b> — mahasiswa Manajemen yang berfokus pada analisis data, pengolahan informasi, dan pemecahan masalah bisnis menggunakan Microsoft Excel dan Google Sheets.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="#work">Explore my works ↗</a><a class="btn secondary" href="#about">About me</a><a aria-label="Download Curriculum Vitae Zaira dalam PDF" class="btn cv-download" download="CV_Zaira_Nur_Azizah.pdf" href="data:application/pdf;base64,">↓ Download CV (PDF)</a></div></div><div aria-label="Foto Zaira dalam acara Grand Showcase CAP" class="heroart"><div class="arch"><img alt="Zaira Nur Azizah menunjukkan sertifikat Champion Ambassador Project" class="realportrait" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/></div><div class="arttag tag1">✳ DATA GIRLIE</div><div class="arttag tag2">♡ BIG DREAMS</div><div class="asterisk">✳</div><div class="star">✦</div></div></header><div class="marquee"><div> ✦ DATA ANALYSIS ✿ CREATIVE THINKING ✦ PROJECT MANAGEMENT ♡ DESIGN &amp; INNOVATION ✦ DATA ANALYSIS ✿ CREATIVE THINKING ✦ PROJECT MANAGEMENT ♡ DESIGN &amp; INNOVATION ✦ DATA ANALYSIS ✿ CREATIVE THINKING ✦ PROJECT MANAGEMENT ♡ DESIGN &amp; INNOVATION</div></div><section class="wrap reveal" id="about"><div class="eyebrow">01 / THE GIRL BEHIND THE IDEAS</div><h2 class="sectitle">A little bit <i>about me.</i> ✿</h2><div class="about"><div class="aboutbox"><h3>About me</h3><p>Aku mahasiswi S1 Manajemen Universitas Nusa Bangsa, dengan minat pada pengumpulan data sekunder, data cleaning, analisis statistik, dan penyajian insight. Aku menggunakan Microsoft Excel, Google Sheets, Word, serta SPSS, dan memiliki pengalaman dalam project evaluasi program, organisasi, dan komunikasi publik.</p><div class="chips"><span class="chip">📍 Bogor, Indonesia</span><span class="chip">🎓 Management Student</span><span class="chip">📊 Data Enthusiast</span></div></div><div class="aboutbox purple"><h3>What makes me, me? ✨</h3><p>Aku menggabungkan Excel, data cleaning, data visualization, public speaking, dan leadership. Aku terus mengasah keterampilan melalui pelatihan digital marketing dan praktik langsung dalam mengolah serta memvisualisasikan data dalam kegiatan kampus serta CAP.</p><div class="chips"><span class="chip">Problem Solving</span><span class="chip">Teamwork</span><span class="chip">Leadership</span><span class="chip">Visual Storytelling</span></div></div></div></section><section class="projects" id="work"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectiontop reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / SELECTED PROJECTS</div><h2 class="sectitle">Things I've <i>made.</i> ★</h2></div><p>Pilihan proyek dan kontribusiku — dengan peran individu dan kerja tim yang dijelaskan secara transparan.</p></div><div class="grid"><article class="project reveal"><div class="projectvisual green screenshot-visual"><img alt="Screenshot asli dashboard Ringkasan CoreMan Cost di Excel, berisi HPP, laba, BEP, target dan grafik" loading="lazy" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></div><div class="projectbody"><div class="index">01 / BUSINESS ANALYTICS · PROJECT PRIBADI</div><h3>CoreMan Cost 📊</h3><p>Project pribadi: aku mengembangkan template Excel untuk membantu UMKM menghitung HPP, harga jual, margin, BEP, target laba, dan perkiraan penjualan.</p><a href="#case-study">Lihat studi kasus &amp; dashboard ↗</a></div></article><article class="project reveal"><div class="projectvisual blue"><span class="bigemoji">📈</span><span class="decosticker">INSIGHTS FROM DATA</span></div><div class="projectbody"><div class="index">02 / PROGRAM EVALUATION · TIM DATA ANALYST</div><h3>CAP Program Analysis 📈</h3><p>Kontribusi: data cleaning, pengolahan hasil survei, analisis perkembangan peserta, dan visualisasi insight untuk kegiatan Champion Ambassador Project.</p><a href="#cap-case-study">Lihat studi kasus evaluasi ↗</a></div></article><article class="project reveal"><div class="projectvisual pink"><span class="bigemoji">♻️</span><span class="decosticker">TEAM PROJECT</span></div><div class="projectbody"><div class="index">03 / SOCIAL IMPACT · PROYEK KELOMPOK</div><h3>Trashily Ecosystem ♻️</h3><p>Proyek kolaborasi pengelolaan sampah berbasis teknologi dan edukasi masyarakat. Peranku di tim Data Analyst; ini bukan proyek milik pribadi.</p><a href="#contact">Let's talk about this ↗</a></div></article></div></div></section><section class="case-study-section" id="case-study"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">03 / FEATURED DATA CASE STUDIES</div><h2 class="sectitle">A closer look at <i>the numbers</i> &amp; stories. ♡</h2><p class="case-intro">Dua studi kasus penerapan analisis data: <b>CoreMan Cost</b> sebagai project pribadi untuk simulasi biaya dan harga usaha, serta <b>Analisis Evaluasi CAP Fase II</b> sebagai kontribusi dalam tim Data Analyst.</p><div class="case-layout"><div class="case-photo"><img alt="Screenshot asli tampilan ringkasan CoreMan Cost di Microsoft Excel" loading="lazy" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><span class="screenshot-caption">📸 Tampilan asli dashboard CoreMan Cost · Data simulasi/contoh</span></div><div class="case-detail"><span class="case-tag">📊 EXCEL · BUSINESS COSTING</span><h3>From cost to clearer decisions ✨</h3><p><b>Tantangan:</b> pelaku UMKM perlu memahami biaya produksi, penentuan harga, laba, dan kebutuhan penjualan tanpa harus menghitung semua secara manual.</p><p><b>Pendekatan:</b> template Excel merangkum input biaya, perhitungan HPP dan laba, analisis BEP, target keuntungan, estimasi penjualan, serta visualisasi grafik.</p><p><b>Output:</b> halaman ringkasan dengan metrik dan interpretasi otomatis untuk membantu pengguna membaca hasil perhitungan.</p><div class="case-metrics"><div><small>HPP / PRODUK</small><strong>Rp10.500</strong></div><div><small>HARGA JUAL</small><strong>Rp15.000</strong></div><div><small>LABA / PRODUK</small><strong>Rp4.500</strong></div><div><small>MARGIN THD. HARGA</small><strong>30%</strong></div></div><p class="case-note">* Angka pada screenshot merupakan contoh pengisian template, bukan hasil penjualan nyata. CoreMan Cost adalah project pribadi yang aku kembangkan.</p></div></div><div class="case-divider"></div><div class="case-subhead" id="cap-case-study"><div class="case-kicker">CASE 02 / PROGRAM EVALUATION</div><h3>Analisis Evaluasi CAP Fase II 📊</h3><p>Studi kasus ini menunjukkan peranku sebagai tim Data Analyst dalam membersihkan data survei peserta, menyusun rekap penilaian, membuat visualisasi, dan menuliskan insight singkat yang siap dipakai untuk kebutuhan booth, banner, atau laporan program.</p></div><div class="case-layout"><div class="case-photo"><img alt="Screenshot asli Analisis Evaluasi CAP Fase II di Microsoft Excel" loading="lazy" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></div><div class="case-copy"><span class="mini">Program evaluation case</span><h3>Dari data survei ke insight yang actionable</h3><p>Fokus analisisnya adalah membaca perkembangan yang dirasakan peserta CAP Fase II dan mengidentifikasi aktivitas mana yang dianggap paling bermanfaat. Data kemudian diringkas ke dalam tabel, skor rata-rata, dan dua grafik utama agar hasilnya mudah dipresentasikan.</p><div class="case-metrics"><div><small>Ringkasan respon peserta</small><strong>24–25 responden</strong></div><div><small>Skor tertinggi: pengetahuan bidang/talent</small><strong>4.40 / 5</strong></div><div><small>Responden memberi skor 4–5 pada aspek tertinggi</small><strong>92%</strong></div><div><small>Aktivitas paling bermanfaat (19 pilihan)</small><strong>Bootcamp Career Goal</strong></div></div><div class="case-highlight"><strong>Insight utama yang ditampilkan</strong><ul><li>Perkembangan paling tinggi terlihat pada pengetahuan bidang/talent (rata-rata 4,40) dan keterampilan praktik (4,28).</li><li>Penggunaan alat/aplikasi juga dinilai baik (4,24), menunjukkan peserta merasa terbantu secara praktis.</li><li>Aktivitas yang paling berkesan bagi peserta adalah Bootcamp Career Goal, mentoring/coaching individual, dan Bootcamp SEL.</li><li>Output analisis ini berguna untuk bahan evaluasi program sekaligus materi komunikasi visual pada booth atau banner.</li></ul></div><p class="case-note">Catatan: angka diringkas dari tampilan dashboard Excel yang kamu kirim. Studi kasus ini difokuskan pada evaluasi peserta, bukan evaluasi mentor.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="academic" id="academic-projects"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">ACADEMIC PROJECTS / STUDI KASUS KULIAH</div><h2 class="sectitle">Research, <i>numbers</i> &amp; findings ✿</h2><p class="academicsub">Kumpulan analisis berbasis data, riset ekonomi, statistik, dan studi kelayakan finansial dari tugas kelompok perkuliahan. Setiap project ditampilkan berdasarkan hasil dokumen dan kontribusi analisis yang dapat dijelaskan secara transparan.</p><div class="acagrid"><article class="acacard reveal"><div class="acavis"><img alt="Cuplikan halaman dari Kelayakan Investasi Dealer Al-Marjan Motor" loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/><span class="bubblelabel">GROUP ACADEMIC PROJECT</span></div><div class="acabody"><span class="acaeyebrow">MANAJEMEN KEUANGAN · 2025/2026</span><h3>Kelayakan Investasi Dealer Al-Marjan Motor</h3><p>Analisis kelayakan finansial usaha dealer sepeda motor berdasarkan data 2021–2023 menggunakan metode PP, ARR, NPV, PI, dan IRR. Laporan kelompok menyatakan investasi layak pada asumsi yang dipakai.</p><div class="acametric"><strong>IRR 26,17%</strong>Di atas tingkat diskonto 18% · kesimpulan dalam laporan: layak</div><div class="acatag"><span>Investment Analysis</span><span>NPV &amp; IRR</span><span>Financial Feasibility</span></div><div class="contribution-note"><strong>LEAD ANALYST · KONTRIBUTOR UTAMA</strong><p>Kontribusi pribadi: kontributor utama (sekitar 90% pengerjaan menurut pembagian kerja kelompok), termasuk analisis finansial, penghitungan indikator investasi, interpretasi, dan penyusunan laporan.</p></div><a class="acalink" href="academic_files/Laporan Menkeu.docx (1).pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Baca laporan kelompok (PDF) ↗</a></div></article><article class="acacard reveal"><div class="acavis"><img alt="Cuplikan halaman dari Inflasi, Suku Bunga &amp; Pertumbuhan Ekonomi Indonesia" loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/><span class="bubblelabel">GROUP ACADEMIC PROJECT</span></div><div class="acabody"><span class="acaeyebrow">STATISTIKA INFERENSIAL · 2010–2023</span><h3>Inflasi, Suku Bunga &amp; Pertumbuhan Ekonomi Indonesia</h3><p>Pengolahan data sekunder tahunan melalui Microsoft Excel untuk regresi linear berganda, statistik deskriptif, uji t, uji F, dan interpretasi koefisien determinasi.</p><div class="acametric"><strong>R² = 26,07%</strong>Uji F p = 0,1899; hasil penelitian tidak signifikan</div><div class="acatag"><span>Microsoft Excel</span><span>Multiple Regression</span><span>Macroeconomics</span></div><div class="contribution-note"><strong>ANALISIS DATA · KONTRIBUSI PRIBADI</strong><p>Kontribusi pribadi: bertanggung jawab atas bagian analisis data dan interpretasi hasil regresi pada laporan kelompok.</p></div><a class="acalink" href="academic_files/PROYEK AKHIR STATISTIKA KEL 1.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Baca laporan kelompok (PDF) ↗</a></div></article><article class="acacard reveal"><div class="acavis"><img alt="Cuplikan halaman dari Analisis Regresi Moderasi dengan SPSS" loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/><span class="bubblelabel">GROUP ACADEMIC PROJECT</span></div><div class="acabody"><span class="acaeyebrow">UAS PENGOLAHAN DATA STATISTIK · 2026</span><h3>Analisis Regresi Moderasi dengan SPSS</h3><p>Analisis pengaruh persepsi kualitas dan persepsi manfaat terhadap minat beli ulang, dengan kepuasan sebagai variabel moderasi. Kontribusi pribadiku berfokus pada interpretasi hasil analisis statistik dan uji asumsi klasik.</p><div class="acametric"><strong>R² Model 2 = 66,4%</strong>Interaksi moderasi tidak signifikan (p = 0,174 &amp; 0,052)</div><div class="acatag"><span>IBM SPSS</span><span>MRA</span><span>Statistical Interpretation</span></div><div class="contribution-note"><strong>ANALYST · IBM SPSS</strong><p>Kontribusi pribadi: bertanggung jawab atas analisis SPSS, pembacaan koefisien, interpretasi hasil, dan uji asumsi klasik.</p></div><a class="acalink" href="academic_files/UAS STATISTIK KEL 5.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Baca laporan kelompok (PDF) ↗</a></div></article><article class="acacard reveal"><div class="acavis"><img alt="Cuplikan halaman dari Analisis PDRB Kabupaten Nganjuk 2020–2024" loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/><span class="bubblelabel">GROUP ACADEMIC PROJECT</span></div><div class="acabody"><span class="acaeyebrow">JURNAL TUGAS KELOMPOK · EKONOMI MAKRO</span><h3>Analisis PDRB Kabupaten Nganjuk 2020–2024</h3><p>Kajian pertumbuhan ekonomi regional berdasarkan data BPS dengan pendekatan laju pertumbuhan, Location Quotient (LQ), dan analisis Shift-Share dalam naskah penelitian kelompok.</p><div class="acametric"><strong>LQ sektor pertanian = 1,02</strong>Pertanian, kehutanan, dan perikanan merupakan sektor basis dalam laporan</div><div class="acatag"><span>Economic Research</span><span>Location Quotient</span><span>BPS Data</span></div><div class="contribution-note"><strong>ANALISIS EKONOMI · KONTRIBUSI PRIBADI</strong><p>Kontribusi pribadi: bertanggung jawab atas bagian analisis ekonomi regional dan interpretasi hasil dalam naskah jurnal kelompok.</p></div><a class="acalink" href="academic_files/Jurnal Analisis PDRB Kabupaten Nganjuk Tahun 2020-2024.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Baca laporan kelompok (PDF) ↗</a></div></article></div><p class="acanote">Catatan: keempat dokumen merupakan hasil kelompok. UAS SPSS menonjolkan peranku pada interpretasi analisis; kontribusi khusus per anggota pada laporan lainnya tidak dirinci. Angka di atas merupakan hasil yang dilaporkan dalam dokumen akademik, bukan audit atau validasi ulang data sumber.</p></div></section><section class="source-section" id="data-sourcing"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">DATA WORKFLOW / SOURCING &amp; RESEARCH</div><h2 class="sectitle">Where the <i>data begins.</i></h2><p>Sebelum menganalisis, aku terbiasa menelusuri sumber data sekunder, memilih seri dan periode yang relevan, lalu menata data agar siap dipakai di Excel atau Google Sheets. Contohnya, pengambilan data harga pangan dari PIHPS Bank Indonesia dan indikator ekonomi dari Badan Pusat Statistik (BPS).</p><div class="source-grid"><article class="source-card"><img alt="Screenshot asli PIHPS — Data Harga Pangan" class="source-img" loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/><div class="source-content"><div class="source-label">DATA COLLECTION · MICROECONOMICS</div><h3>PIHPS — Data Harga Pangan</h3><p>Mengumpulkan dan merekap data harga minyak goreng dari PIHPS. File rekap memuat tanggal serta tiga kategori: minyak curah, minyak kemasan 1, dan minyak kemasan 2.</p><div class="source-chips"><span>Excel</span><span>Data Recap</span><span>Price Monitoring</span></div></div></article><article class="source-card"><img alt="Screenshot asli BPS — Data Indikator Ekonomi" class="source-img" loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/><div class="source-content"><div class="source-label">DATA SOURCING · STATISTICS</div><h3>BPS — Data Indikator Ekonomi</h3><p>Menggunakan BPS Query Builder untuk menelusuri dan mengekspor seri pertumbuhan PDB serta data inflasi dalam format CSV, sebagai sumber data sekunder untuk tugas analisis statistik.</p><div class="source-chips"><span>BPS Query Builder</span><span>CSV</span><span>Excel</span></div></div></article></div><p class="source-note">Dokumentasi berasal dari screenshot dan file data yang aku gunakan dalam kegiatan akademik. Bagian ini menampilkan proses pengambilan dan penataan data, bukan mengklaim hasil riset atau publikasi independen.</p></div></section><section class="wrap skillsarea" id="skills"><div class="reveal"><div class="eyebrow">03 / WHAT I BRING TO THE TABLE</div><h2 class="sectitle">Tools &amp; <i>skills.</i></h2><p class="lead">Mengolah dan menyajikan data untuk mendukung evaluasi dan pengambilan keputusan. Tools yang biasa aku gunakan: Microsoft Excel, Google Sheets, Microsoft Word, serta IBM SPSS Statistics untuk analisis statistik. Aku juga terbiasa mengambil data sekunder dari BPS dan PIHPS.</p><div class="chips"><span class="chip">Microsoft Excel</span><span class="chip">Google Sheets</span><span class="chip">Microsoft Word</span><span class="chip">Data Cleaning</span><span class="chip">Data Visualization</span><span class="chip">IBM SPSS Statistics · Regression</span><span class="chip">Business Analysis</span><span class="chip">Public Speaking</span><span class="chip">Leadership</span><span class="chip">Data Sourcing · BPS &amp; PIHPS</span></div></div><div class="skillcards reveal"><div class="skill"><div>📊</div><strong>Data Analysis</strong><small>Cleaning, statistics &amp; insights</small></div><div class="skill"><div>📈</div><strong>Excel &amp; Sheets</strong><small>Tables, formulas &amp; charts</small></div><div class="skill"><div>💼</div><strong>Business Analysis</strong><small>Financial feasibility &amp; costing</small></div><div class="skill"><div>🤝</div><strong>Communication</strong><small>Presentation &amp; teamwork</small></div></div></section><section class="journey" id="journey"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">04 / EXPERIENCE &amp; GROWTH</div><h2 class="sectitle">The journey so <i>far.</i> ☁</h2><div class="timeline"><div class="timecard reveal"><span class="year">2024–2025</span><h3>Host Live — Pusat Niaga 🎙️</h3><p>Host Live di Pusat Niaga (2024–2025). Membawakan siaran langsung, berinteraksi dengan audiens, dan mengasah komunikasi persuasif serta presentasi produk.</p></div><div class="timecard reveal"><span class="year">ORGANISASI KAMPUS</span><h3>Bendahara KSPM 💼</h3><p>Berperan sebagai Bendahara Kelompok Studi Pasar Modal (KSPM) di Universitas Nusa Bangsa.</p></div><div class="timecard reveal"><span class="year">KEPANITIAAN</span><h3>Seminar Sekolah Pasar Modal 📚</h3><p>Panitia peresmian Galeri Investasi BEI UNB dan Sekolah Pasar Modal pada 9 Juni 2026; berkontribusi pada kebendaharaan dan data cleaning.</p><div class="presslinks"><a href="https://pilarmerdeka.com/unb-resmi-miliki-galeri-investasi-bei-wadah-eduka/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Pilar Merdeka ↗</a><a href="https://www.kobrapostonline.com/galeri-investasi-bursa-efek-indonesia-resm/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Kobra Post ↗</a></div></div><div class="timecard reveal"><span class="year">2026</span><h3>Peserta CAP Fase II — Bidang Data Analyst ✨</h3><p>Mengikuti Champion Ambassador Project Fase II sebagai peserta Bidang Data Analyst, termasuk mentoring Microsoft Excel. Berkontribusi dalam analisis evaluasi survei peserta sebagai bagian dari project tim.</p></div><div class="timecard reveal"><span class="year">2026 · CHAMPION AMBASSADOR PROJECT</span><h3>Mentoring Microsoft Excel 📗</h3><p>Mengikuti mentoring Excel selama Champion Ambassador Project untuk memperdalam pengolahan data, penggunaan fitur spreadsheet, dan penyajian analisis secara lebih terstruktur.</p></div><div class="timecard reveal"><span class="year">PELATIHAN</span><h3>Data &amp; Digital Marketing 🎓</h3><p>Memiliki sertifikat Data Analyst dan mengikuti pelatihan Digital Marketing bersama LSP Digital Marketing Indonesia.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="gallery-section" id="gallery"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sectiontop reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">05 / MOMENTS &amp; MEMORIES</div><h2 class="sectitle">A little <i>photo diary.</i> 📸</h2></div><p>Potongan momen nyata dari pengalaman kolaborasi, pengembangan diri, dan kegiatan kampus.</p></div>
